    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "10 The Downs, Lakepoint Park, Mullingar, Co. Westmeath N91 F728\r\n\r\nOne-Bedroom Apartment in a Popular Residential Location\r\n\r\nAsking Price: €149,950\r\n\r\nA well-presented first-floor one-bedroom apartment ideally positioned within the popular Lakepoint Park development, overlooking a pleasant green area.\r\nThis attractive apartment offers an excellent opportunity for a first-time buyer, investor or anyone seeking a conveniently located property in Mullingar.\r\nThe property is situated in a well-established residential area, within easy reach of Mullingar town centre, while also benefiting from excellent access to the N4 and being located close to St. Loman's Hospital.\r\n\r\nWith its practical accommodation, parking, gas-fired central heating and convenient location, 10 The Downs represents an appealing opportunity in the Mullingar property market.\r\n________________________________________\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n•\tOne-bedroom first-floor apartment\r\n•\tPopular Lakepoint Park residential development\r\n•\tOverlooking a green area\r\n•\tIdeal for first-time buyers or investors\r\n•\tWalking distance to Mullingar town\r\n•\tConvenient access to the N4\r\n•\tLocated beside St. Loman's Hospital\r\n•\tGas-fired central heating\r\n•\tPVC double-glazed windows and doors\r\n•\tAllocated parking\r\n•\tC3 Energy Rating\r\n•\tFurnished accommodation\r\n•\tViewing highly recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n1.49m x 1.26m\r\nWelcoming entrance hall with timber flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Living Area\r\n4.21m x 3.78m\r\nA bright and practical open-plan living space featuring timber flooring and fitted kitchen units.\r\nThe kitchen is equipped with an oven, hotplate, extractor fan, washing machine and fridge freezer. The living area is presented with a table and two chairs and coffee table, making this a comfortable and functional space for everyday living.\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom\r\n3.74m x 2.97m\r\nWell-proportioned double bedroom with timber flooring, built-in wardrobe, double bed and bedside locker.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.06m x 1.93m\r\nFully fitted bathroom with tiled walls and floor, WC, bath, wash hand basin and electric shower.\r\n\r\n\r\nA Location That Works for You\r\n\r\nLakepoint Park is a popular residential setting in Mullingar, offering the convenience of established local amenities while remaining well connected to the wider area.\r\nThe property is particularly well positioned for access to Mullingar town centre, providing a range of shops, cafés, restaurants, services and leisure facilities within easy reach.\r\nFor commuters, the property's proximity to the N4 provides convenient connectivity towards Dublin and the Midlands, while its location close to St. Loman's Hospital adds further appeal.\r\nWhether you're taking your first step onto the property ladder or looking for an investment property in an established residential location, 10 The Downs offers an opportunity worth viewing.\r\n________________________________________\r\nIdeal for First-Time Buyers or Investors\r\n\r\nThis one-bedroom apartment combines manageable accommodation, a convenient location and excellent accessibility, making it an attractive proposition for a range of purchasers.\r\nFor a first-time buyer, it offers an opportunity to acquire a home in a well-established residential development. For an investor, its location close to Mullingar town, St. Loman's Hospital and the N4 provides a number of factors that may appeal to the rental market.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
